    },
    "message": "Read only unsettled support requests during a tick, and enter phase scopes cheaply\n\nThe last end-of-tick check knows which requests are settled, and settled requests\nreport writes, so the scans in assign_pending, the metrics and the complaint check\nread the rest. Anything uncertain reads every request. Also stop re-parsing a status\nthat is already the enum, and build the metric sources through canonical_json.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
