    },
    "message": "Collect the youngest generation after 200,000 objects while computing\n\nMost objects it walked live only until the next save, so a wider interval reads them\nless often: a late 1,500-minute window spends 0.45 s collecting instead of 1.03 s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
