    },
    "message": "Trim repeated work in tick views, pair keys and event records\n\nKeep what a parsed person context gives, build need views and deltas directly, remember\nrelationship keys, and skip enum and Mapping checks of values already known. Results\nare bit-identical; no model formula or coefficient changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
